1
00:00:00,145 --> 00:00:02,215
(Bernadette:)Okay, I guess I should
eat the Hell Prawn.

2
00:00:02,213 --> 00:00:03,183
(Sheldon:)Using your sword,

3
00:00:03,181 --> 00:00:05,481
(Sheldon:)you prepare a beautiful
sushi dinner.

4
00:00:05,483 --> 00:00:08,653
(Sheldon:)You slip into the hot spring
and enjoy the warm water

5
00:00:08,653 --> 00:00:09,783
(Sheldon:)on your aching joints.

6
00:00:09,787 --> 00:00:11,057
(Sheldon:)As you happily
close your eyes,

7
00:00:11,055 --> 00:00:13,355
(Sheldon:)you recall the incredible
evening you've had

8
00:00:13,358 --> 00:00:14,788
(Sheldon:)and notice that your...

9
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:16,192
(die clinks)

10
00:00:16,194 --> 00:00:20,564
(Sheldon:)...feet and ankles are
smaller than they've ever been.

11
00:00:20,565 --> 00:00:22,235
(Sheldon:)The end.

12
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:26,003
(Bernadette:)Wow, this night turned out to be
so much more fun than I thought.

13
00:00:26,004 --> 00:00:27,334
(Sheldon:)Oh, the fun doesn't stop.

14
00:00:27,338 --> 00:00:29,808
(Sheldon:)You're still going home
with a goodie bag full of toast.

15
00:00:33,077 --> 00:00:34,777
(Bernadette:)Thank you for this.

16
00:00:34,779 --> 00:00:37,479
(Bernadette:)You know, ever since people
found out I'm having a baby,

17
00:00:37,482 --> 00:00:40,282
(Bernadette:)I feel like I became
Pregnant Bernadette.

18
00:00:40,285 --> 00:00:42,415
(Bernadette:)It was nice to take
a little break tonight.

19
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,550
(Sheldon:)I can understand that.

20
00:00:44,556 --> 00:00:46,926
(Sheldon:)From the moment
people realized I was a genius,

21
00:00:46,925 --> 00:00:48,725
(Sheldon:)I've been Sheldon the Genius.

22
00:00:50,628 --> 00:00:52,458
(Sheldon:)Although I've never really
wanted a break from that,

23
00:00:52,463 --> 00:00:54,093
(Sheldon:)so I suppose I don't understand.

24
00:00:54,098 --> 00:00:55,828
(Sheldon:)Which is ironic

25
00:00:55,833 --> 00:00:57,833
(Sheldon:)'cause, you know, genius.

26
00:00:57,835 --> 00:01:00,025
(chuckles)

